exports[`permissions.nudges.sh given: [case1] a ledger with nudges and retries when: [t0] the summary is asked for then: the whole report is snapshotted 1`] = `
"🐢 heres the wave...

🐚 permissions.nudges
   ├─ ledger: .agent/.cache/repo=ehmpathy/role=mechanic/skill=check-permissions/nudges.jsonl
   ├─ nudged parts: 8
   ├─ retried through to a human: 2 (25%)
   ├─ by verdict
   │  ├─ nudged (6)
   │  └─ retried (2)
   ├─ heads with no paved path (pave these)
   │  ├─ sort (3)
   │  └─ tide (1)
   └─ heads nudged most
      ├─ grep (4)
      ├─ sort (3)
      └─ tide (1)

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ a head with no paved path that recurs is a skill to pave: start in .agent/repo=.this/role=any/skills/
   └─ a head every repo hits belongs upstream: rhx radio.task.push --via gh.issues --into ehmpathy/rhachet-roles-ehmpathy --title 'pave: <head>' --description @stdin
"
`;

